{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nLeft column listing the projects of the repository owner.\n\n## Spec\n- `gh project list --owner <owner> --format json` where `<owner>` is the current repository's owner (org or user); closed projects excluded\n- Rows: number, title, item count, updated (relative); projects linked to the current repository (`gh repo view --json … ` / project `repositories`) are listed first with a marker\n- `/` search over title; selecting a project loads its board (`bind select=\"projects\" detail=\"board\"`)\n- `r` refetches; the list is also refreshed when the page is activated after a while\n\nPart of #119.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T08:11:59Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":121,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: project list pane"}
